abstract: >
  Open-source Python and Marimo application for comparing one
  National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST) Tracking Community
  Resilience (TraCR) indicator across multiple geographies over time.
  The project demonstrates a reusable analytical pipeline from public source
  data through acquisition, processing, analysis, view preparation, and
  interactive visualization using multiple rendering libraries.

